    "Reason : 1 - Owing to the excessive combined scale and bulk of the proposed additions, their cramped and incongruous design and their inappropriate positioning in relation to neighbouring houses, the proposal would cause harm to the character and appearance of the area, contrary to Local Plan policies CC1, CC2 and SC7 and the intent of the Residential Extension Guidelines. ",
